Description: compact Wayland desktop music player
 LoFiBox is a pure C++ Linux music player with a compact
 Wayland compositor-managed desktop window. It is designed around local
 playback, media-library browsing, metadata and artwork, remote-source
 extensibility, and a DSP-ready audio pipeline.

Package: lofibox-cardputer-zero
Build-Profiles: <pkg.lofibox.cardputer>
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 alsa-utils,
 ffmpeg,
 python3,
 python3-mutagen
Recommends:
 fonts-noto-cjk
Conflicts: lofibox
Description: framebuffer music player for Cardputer Zero
 LoFiBox for Cardputer Zero renders directly to the Linux framebuffer
 and reads the hardware keyboard through evdev. It includes APPLaunch
 integration, local playback, media-library browsing, metadata, lyrics,
 queue control, DSP and WebUI remote control.
